# Notification-surface probe, 2026-10-27.
#
# A temporary test in src/litric-shell/src/e2e.rs drove the shell's real input
# path, printed the states below, and was then removed (the tree is clean of it:
# `git checkout -- src/litric-shell/src/e2e.rs`). Command:
#
#   cargo test -p litric-shell --lib probe_notification_surfaces -- --nocapture
#
# The banner sample is read from the rendered canvas at (screen.w - 160,
# top_bar.h + 40) before and after four notifications, with thirty 16 ms ticks
# in between: the banner arrives on a spring, so a single frame after `notify`
# legitimately shows nothing yet.

